<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Instrument.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Instrument.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded General Instrument Corp to hold from buy after the company reported lower-than-expected third-quarter results.</p>
<p>-- It reported earnings of $0.30 a share for the quarter, below UBS's estimate by one penny.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 26-7/8 and was indicated to open at 22-1/2 to 24.</p>
</text>
